अति-√ क्रम् to step or go beyond or over or across, (Ved. Inf. अति-क्र॑मे, to be walked on RV. i, 105, 16);
to pass, cross;
to pass time;
to surpass, excel, overcome;
to pass by, neglect;
to overstep, transgress, violate;
to pass on or away;
to step out;
to part from, lose:
Caus. -क्रामयति, or -क्रमयति, to allow to pass (as time);
to leave unnoticed.

अति-√ गम् or अति-√ गा, to pass by or over ;
