 redundancy;
 difference.

अति-√ वह् to carry over or across to pass by;
to pass (time), Daś. :
Caus. वाहयति, to let pass, get over or through, endure;
to let time pass, spend.

अति-√ 2. वा cl. 2. P. -वाति, to blow beyond, AV.;
cl. 4. P. -वयति, to blow violently;
 (अति-वायति), pr.p. loc. (ind.) the wind blowing strongly, MBh.

अति-√ वृत् to pass beyond, surpass, cross;
to get over, overcome;
to transgress, violate, offend, especially by unfaithfulness;
to pass away;
to delay.

अति-√ व्रज् to pass by;
to fly over, RV. i, 116, 4;
to pass or wander through.

अति-√ शङ्क् to suspect strongly, Lāṭy.;
to suspect falsely;
to be concerned about.

1. अति-√ 1. शी -शेते, to precede in lying down, MBh.;
to surpass, excel;
to act as an incubus, annoy, L. :
Pass. -शय्यते, to be excelled or surpassed.

अति-ष्कन्द् (√ स्कन्द्) to cover (said of a bull), RV. v, 52, 3;
to leap or jump over, Ved. Inf. (dat.) अति-ष्क॑दे, RV. viii, 67, 59;
 Ved. Inf. (abl.) -ष्क॑दस्, RV. x, 108, 2;
to omit;
अ॑न्-अतिस्कन्दत् (mfn.) not omitting anything, uniform, TBr.

अति-√ सृ Caus. to cause to pass through:
Pass. -सार्यते;
to be purged, Suśr.

अति-√ सृज् to glide over or along, RV.;
to send away dismiss, abandon;
to leave as a remnant, to remit, forgive;
to give away, present, to create in a higher degree, ŚBr. xiv.

अति-√ हृ to hold over;
to reach over;
to cause to jut over;
to add.
